SUMMARY:Women In Palestine Webinar (Offsite and Online)
DESCRIPTION:The Ongoing Nakba and Prospects for Peace and Justice for Palestinians \nPresented in collaboration with the Central Atlantic Conference\, United Church Of Christ\, this webinar features Rifat Kassis\, the General Coordinator of Kairos Palestine\, and Rev. Dr. Munther Isaac\, pastor of the Evangelical Lutheran Church of Hope in Ramallah\, Palestine\, and Founding Director of the Bethlehem Institute of Peace and Justice\, a center affiliated with the Bethlehem Bible College.  \nMr. Kassis and Rev. Isaac are co-authors of the Kairos Palestine II document\, and both are contributing authors to Rooted in Faith and Justice: Christian Calls to Conscience & Cries for Peace in Palestine. Together\, they will help those attending to dive deeper into the reality of Palestinian Christians today\, their witness and context\, and what is required of the global Christian community to accompany them.  Online Registration is  HERE
URL:https://www.unioncong.org/event/women-in-palestine-webinar-offsite-and-online-2/
LOCATION:Offsite and Online
CATEGORIES:All Church Events,All Events
ORGANIZER;CN="Global Ministries":MAILTO:GlobalMinistriesWeb@ucc.org
END:VEVENT
